        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nskinparam rectangle {\n  RoundCorner 10\n  FontSize 11\n  FontColor #1A2235\n}\nskinparam arrow {\n  Color #3A6BD4\n  FontColor #3A6BD4\n  FontSize 10\n}\nskinparam defaultFontName DM Sans\nskinparam linetype ortho\n\ntitle Three-Tier Architecture — AI-Driven Smart LMS\n\n&#39; ── Tier 1: Presentation ─────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Tier 1 — Presentation Layer**\&quot; as T1 #EEF4FF {\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**React.js SPA**\&quot; as React #D6E4FF {\n    rectangle \&quot;Admin Portal\&quot; as P1 #BDD4FF\n    rectangle \&quot;Teacher Portal\&quot; as P2 #BDD4FF\n    rectangle \&quot;Student Portal\&quot; as P3 #BDD4FF\n  }\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Frontend Services**\&quot; as FS #D6E4FF {\n    rectangle \&quot;Axios HTTP Client\\n+ JWT Interceptor\&quot; as Axios #BDD4FF\n    rectangle \&quot;WebSocket Client\\n(Real-Time Chat)\&quot; as WSC #BDD4FF\n    rectangle \&quot;Neumorphic\\nDesign System\&quot; as UI #BDD4FF\n  }\n\n}\n\n&#39; ── Tier 2: Business Logic ────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Tier 2 — Business Logic Layer**\&quot; as T2 #EFFFEF {\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**FastAPI Backend**\&quot; as FastAPI #C8F0DC {\n    rectangle \&quot;API Routers\\n(/api/v1/...)\&quot; as Routers #A8E0C0\n    rectangle \&quot;JWT Auth\\nMiddleware\&quot; as Auth #A8E0C0\n    rectangle \&quot;RBAC\\nDependencies\&quot; as RBAC #A8E0C0\n  }\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Service Classes**\&quot; as Services #C8F0DC {\n    rectangle \&quot;Auth\\nService\&quot; as S1 #A8E0C0\n    rectangle \&quot;Enrollment\\nService\&quot; as S2 #A8E0C0\n    rectangle \&quot;Attendance\\nService\&quot; as S3 #A8E0C0\n    rectangle \&quot;Assessment\\nService\&quot; as S4 #A8E0C0\n    rectangle \&quot;Fee\\nService\&quot; as S5 #A8E0C0\n    rectangle \&quot;Communication\\nService\&quot; as S6 #A8E0C0\n  }\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Pydantic Schemas**\\nRequest / Response\\nValidation\&quot; as Schemas #C8F0DC\n\n}\n\n&#39; ── AI Layer (Cross-Cutting) ──────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**AI Layer — Cross-Cutting Concern**\&quot; as AIL #F5EEFF {\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Face Recognition**\\nEngine (Dlib)\&quot; as AI1 #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;**Chatbot Engine**\\n(Gemini + FAISS)\&quot; as AI2 #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;**Analytics**\\nEngine\&quot; as AI3 #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;**Quiz Generator**\\n(Gemini)\&quot; as AI4 #EDE0FF\n  rectangle \&quot;**Plagiarism**\\nDetector\&quot; as AI5 #EDE0FF\n\n}\n\n&#39; ── Tier 3: Data ──────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Tier 3 — Data Layer**\&quot; as T3 #FFFDE7 {\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**SQLAlchemy ORM**\\nModel Classes\\nSession Management\&quot; as ORM #FFF9C4\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**MySQL 8.x Database**\&quot; as DB #FFF9C4 {\n    rectangle \&quot;Users &amp;\\nProfiles\&quot; as D1 #FFF0A0\n    rectangle \&quot;Academic\\nStructure\&quot; as D2 #FFF0A0\n    rectangle \&quot;Attendance\\nRecords\&quot; as D3 #FFF0A0\n    rectangle \&quot;Assessment\\nData\&quot; as D4 #FFF0A0\n    rectangle \&quot;Fee &amp;\\nVouchers\&quot; as D5 #FFF0A0\n    rectangle \&quot;AI Analytics\\n&amp; Chat Logs\&quot; as D6 #FFF0A0\n  }\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**File Storage**\\nuploads/avatars\\nuploads/assignments\&quot; as Files #FFF9C4\n  rectangle \&quot;**FAISS Index**\\nFAQ Vector Store\\nEmbeddings\&quot; as FAISS #FFF9C4\n\n}\n\n&#39; ── Tier 1 → Tier 2 ──────────────────────────────\nAxios  -down-&gt; Routers  : HTTP REST\\nRequests\nWSC    -down-&gt; FastAPI   : WebSocket\\nConnection\nRouters -down-&gt; Auth    : Validate\\nJWT Token\nAuth    -down-&gt; RBAC    : Check\\nRole\nRBAC    -down-&gt; Services : Route to\\nService\n\n&#39; ── Tier 2 → AI Layer ────────────────────────────\nS1 -down-&gt; AI1 : Face Login\\n&amp; Enroll\nS3 -down-&gt; AI1 : Gate\\nAttendance\nS4 -down-&gt; AI4 : Generate\\nQuiz\nS4 -down-&gt; AI5 : Check\\nPlagiarism\nS6 -down-&gt; AI2 : Chatbot\\nMessage\nS2 -down-&gt; AI3 : Calculate\\nAnalytics\n\n&#39; ── Tier 2 → Tier 3 ──────────────────────────────\nServices -down-&gt; ORM   : DB Queries\\nvia ORM\nORM      -down-&gt; DB    : SQL\\nQueries\nS4       -down-&gt; Files : File\\nUpload\nAI2      -down-&gt; FAISS : Vector\\nSearch\n\n&#39; ── Schemas ──────────────────────────────────────\nRouters -right-&gt; Schemas : Validate\\nInput/Output\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="14pVjtuajESJFR7WagT--21">
